# Bottomless Pool, cast as the left door: "When you unlock this door, return up to one target creature to its owner's hand." (CR 709.5h: a
# door cast as the Room is unlocked as it enters). Bot1's own Ornithopter is a legal target (not only an opponent's) and goes back to its hand;
# the Room keeps only Bottomless Pool unlocked, with Locker Room still locked.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Bottomless Pool // Locker Room
Island x4
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Bottomless Pool // Locker Room.Cast(Ability: Bottomless Pool)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Bottomless Pool.Doors = Bottomless Pool
[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Island; Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield = Bottomless Pool; Mox Sapphire
